# Everything the image does not need, and one thing it must never have.
#
# .env is listed first because it is the reason this file exists: a copied
# .env would bake credentials into an image layer, where they survive every
# later deletion and travel to anyone who can pull the image. Configuration
# reaches the container through the environment at run time.
.env
.env.*

node_modules
dist
coverage
.git
.gitignore
*.md
tests
vitest.config.*
